   "text": "Wingman Core\n(Python-Sidecar, FastAPI + WebSocket)\n\nSecret »wingman_pro« = B2C-Access-Token\nWingmanSubscription-Provider:\n/ask, /transcribe-*, /generate-*-speech,\n/generate-image, /azure-voices, /inworld-voices",
