   "text": "PayPro Global (Merchant of Record)\n\nHosted Checkout mit billing-email +\nCustom-Feld x-azure-user-id (= B2C objectId)\nSubscription-API (GetDetails/Suspend/Renew)\nProducts-API (Preise/Währung)\nIPN-Webhooks → wingman-webhook",
